<!doctype lake><title>教案14-组合类型</title><meta name="doc-version" content="1" /><meta name="viewport" content="fixed" /><meta name="typography" content="classic" /><meta name="paragraphSpacing" content="relax" /><h1 data-lake-id="N39rB" id="N39rB"><span data-lake-id="ua0c3daa5" id="ua0c3daa5">1.结构体</span></h1><p data-lake-id="42b1e1367c53efa85f426d487d694534" id="42b1e1367c53efa85f426d487d694534" style="text-indent: 2em"><span data-lake-id="u433ed8ee" id="u433ed8ee" class="lake-fontsize-12">C语言提供了众多的基本类型，但现实生活中的对象一般都不是单纯的整型、浮点型或字符串，而是这些基本类型的综合体。比如一个学生，典型地应该拥有学号（整型）、姓名（字符串）、分数（浮点型）、性别（枚举）等不同侧面的属性，这些所有的属性都不应该被拆分开来，而是应该组成一个整体，代表一个完整的学生。</span></p><p data-lake-id="64011e9c24f2adac41ab55e771f35f66" id="64011e9c24f2adac41ab55e771f35f66" style="text-indent: 2em"><span data-lake-id="u8da54e4d" id="u8da54e4d" class="lake-fontsize-12">在C语言中，可以使用结构体来将多种不同的数据类型组装起来，形成某种现实意义的自定义的变量类型。结构体本质上是一种自定义类型。</span></p><p data-lake-id="2952706fdb53f97b4e48fad4b4673f90" id="2952706fdb53f97b4e48fad4b4673f90"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F46168485%2F1735560167408-8f0b6093-e448-4d6e-9ebd-c8f65154f8f5.png%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A526%2C%22height%22%3A176%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A743%2C%22originHeight%22%3A248%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f8f4f0%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22PJF0f%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><p data-lake-id="640f4feb206df8ba45e952e0efdb2068" id="640f4feb206df8ba45e952e0efdb2068"><span data-lake-id="ua1b5c345" id="ua1b5c345" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id="0411a4e0d3209aeb2c1c9664723429b6" id="0411a4e0d3209aeb2c1c9664723429b6" style="text-indent: 2em"><span data-lake-id="u7a080b08" id="u7a080b08" class="lake-fontsize-12">C语言没有其他语言的对象（object）和类（class）的概念，struct 结构很大程度上提供了对象和类的功能。</span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%84%E4%BD%93%E7%9A%84%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%EF%BC%9A%5Cnstruct%20%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%84%E4%BD%93%E6%A0%87%E7%AD%BE%5Cn%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%E6%88%90%E5%91%981%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%E6%88%90%E5%91%982%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20...%5Cn%7D%3B%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22dS4vN%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="437da31d53870fbf8ca9800035e0dfe2" id="437da31d53870fbf8ca9800035e0dfe2"><span data-lake-id="u1b0de53d" id="u1b0de53d" class="lake-fontsize-12">语法：</span></p><p data-lake-id="4549f3721196cf46495f4d6602a65dca" id="4549f3721196cf46495f4d6602a65dca"><span data-lake-id="u06bb8881" id="u06bb8881" class="lake-fontsize-12">结构体标签：用来区分各个不同的结构体。</span></p><p data-lake-id="499bc3fb930b09ffa091a044a03719c1" id="499bc3fb930b09ffa091a044a03719c1"><span data-lake-id="u3e3b753d" id="u3e3b753d" class="lake-fontsize-12">成员：是包含在结构体内部的数据，可以是任意的数据类型。</span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23include%20%3Cstdio.h%3E%5Cn%23include%20%3Cstdlib.h%3E%5Cn%5Cn%2F%2F%20%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%84%E4%BD%93%E5%A3%B0%E6%98%8E%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%9A%E6%98%AF%E5%9C%A8%E5%85%A8%E5%B1%80%E5%8F%98%E9%87%8F%E6%88%96%E8%80%85%E5%9C%A8%E5%A4%B4%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6%EF%BC%8C%E5%A3%B0%E6%98%8E%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%84%E4%BD%93%E4%B8%8D%E5%8D%A0%E7%94%A8%E7%A9%BA%E9%97%B4%5Cnstruct%20student%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20char%20*name%3B%20%20%2F%2F%E5%A7%93%E5%90%8D%5Cn%20%20%20%20int%20num%3B%20%20%2F%2F%E5%AD%A6%E5%8F%B7%5Cn%20%20%20%20int%20age%3B%20%20%2F%2F%E5%B9%B4%E9%BE%84%5Cn%20%20%20%20char%20group%3B%20%20%2F%2F%E6%89%80%E5%9C%A8%E5%AD%A6%E4%B9%A0%E5%B0%8F%E7%BB%84%5Cn%20%20%20%20float%20score%3B%20%20%2F%2F%E6%88%90%E7%BB%A9%5Cn%7D%3B%20%2F%2F%20%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%E5%AE%8C%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%84%E4%BD%93%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%9A%E8%A6%81%E6%B7%BB%E5%8A%A0%E5%88%86%E5%8F%B7%E7%BB%93%E6%9D%9F%5Cn%5Cnint%20main()%5Cn%7B%5Cn%20%20%20struct%20student%20stu%3B%20%5Cn%7D%5Cn%2F*%E5%83%8F%20int%E3%80%81float%E3%80%81char%20%E7%AD%89%E6%98%AF%E7%94%B1C%E8%AF%AD%E8%A8%80%E6%9C%AC%E8%BA%AB%E6%8F%90%E4%BE%9B%E7%9A%84%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E7%B1%BB%E5%9E%8B%EF%BC%8C%5Cn%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E5%86%8D%E8%BF%9B%E8%A1%8C%E5%88%86%E6%8B%86%EF%BC%8C%E6%88%91%E4%BB%AC%E7%A7%B0%E4%B9%8B%E4%B8%BA%E5%9F%BA%E6%9C%AC%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E7%B1%BB%E5%9E%8B%EF%BC%9B%5Cn%E8%80%8C%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%84%E4%BD%93%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E5%8C%85%E5%90%AB%E5%A4%9A%E4%B8%AA%E5%9F%BA%E6%9C%AC%E7%B1%BB%E5%9E%8B%E7%9A%84%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%EF%BC%8C%5Cn%E4%B9%9F%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E5%8C%85%E5%90%AB%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E7%9A%84%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%84%E4%BD%93%EF%BC%8C%E6%88%91%E4%BB%AC%E5%B0%86%E5%AE%83%E7%A7%B0%E4%B8%BA%E5%A4%8D%E6%9D%82%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E7%B1%BB%E5%9E%8B%E6%88%96%E6%9E%84%E9%80%A0%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E7%B1%BB%E5%9E%8B%E3%80%82%5Cn*%2F%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22pZCc9%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="d17b3a01d0d3045370ff73c5f42743a1" id="d17b3a01d0d3045370ff73c5f42743a1"><span data-lake-id="u2dc42145" id="u2dc42145" class="lake-fontsize-12">其他定义方式：</span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%2F%2Fstudent%20%E5%B0%B1%E5%83%8F%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E2%80%9C%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF%E2%80%9D%EF%BC%8C%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%E5%87%BA%E6%9D%A5%E7%9A%84%E5%8F%98%E9%87%8F%E9%83%BD%E5%85%B7%E6%9C%89%E7%9B%B8%E5%90%8C%E7%9A%84%E6%80%A7%E8%B4%A8%E3%80%82%5Cn%5Cn%2F%2F1.%E6%99%AE%E9%80%9A%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%5Cnstruct%20student%20stu1%2C%20stu2%3B%5Cn%5Cn%2F%2F2.%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%84%E4%BD%93%E5%8F%98%E9%87%8F%E7%9A%84%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%E4%B9%9F%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E4%B8%8E%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%84%E4%BD%93%E7%9A%84%E5%A3%B0%E6%98%8E%E5%90%8C%E6%97%B6%EF%BC%8C%E8%BF%99%E6%A0%B7%E5%B0%B1%E7%AE%80%E5%8C%96%E4%BA%86%E4%BB%A3%E7%A0%81%5Cnstruct%20student%7B%20%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20char%20*name%3B%20%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20int%20num%3B%20%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20int%20age%3B%20%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20char%20group%3B%20%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20float%20score%3B%20%5Cn%7D%20stu1%2C%20stu2%3B%5Cn%5Cn%2F%2F3.%E8%BF%98%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E5%8C%BF%E5%90%8D%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%84%E4%BD%93%E6%9D%A5%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%84%E4%BD%93%E5%8F%98%E9%87%8F%5Cnstruct%20%7B%20%20%2F%2F%E6%B2%A1%E6%9C%89%E5%86%99student%5Cn%20%20%20%20char%20*name%3B%20%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20int%20num%3B%20%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20int%20age%3B%20%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20char%20group%3B%20%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20float%20score%3B%20%20%5Cn%7D%20stu1%2C%20stu2%3B%5Cn%2F%2F%E8%BF%99%E6%A0%B7%E7%9A%84%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E5%86%8D%E6%AC%A1%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%E6%96%B0%E7%9A%84%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%84%E4%BD%93%E5%8F%98%E9%87%8F%E4%BA%86%5Cn%5Cn%2F%2F4.typedef%E6%98%AF%E7%B1%BB%E5%9E%8B%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%E7%9A%84%E6%84%8F%E6%80%9D%E3%80%82typedef%20struct%20%E6%98%AF%E4%B8%BA%E4%BA%86%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E8%BF%99%E4%B8%AA%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%84%E4%BD%93%E6%96%B9%E4%BE%BF%E3%80%82%5Cntypedef%20struct%20%7B%20%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20char%20*name%3B%20%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20int%20num%3B%20%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20int%20age%3B%20%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20char%20group%3B%20%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20float%20score%3B%20%20%5Cn%7Dstudent%3B%20%20%2F%2F%E8%BF%99%E6%A0%B7%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E7%94%A8student%E6%9D%A5%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%84%E4%BD%93%E5%AF%B9%E8%B1%A1%E4%BA%86%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22mCpz2%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="f32ea72b1a577826bfabccb655e6d070" id="f32ea72b1a577826bfabccb655e6d070"><span data-lake-id="u968440c4" id="u968440c4" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id="ace1c4653aeabab2040c0b72f958d872" id="ace1c4653aeabab2040c0b72f958d872"><span data-lake-id="ua680f54f" id="ua680f54f" class="lake-fontsize-12">结构体初始化</span></p><p data-lake-id="0d4b71308272c2e2f44a4e5cfc515ede" id="0d4b71308272c2e2f44a4e5cfc515ede" style="text-indent: 2em"><span data-lake-id="u3fde31a9" id="u3fde31a9" class="lake-fontsize-12">结构体跟普通变量一样，涉及定义、初始化、赋值、取址、传值等等操作，这些操作绝大部分都跟普通变量别无二致，只有少数操作有些特殊性。这其实也是结构体这种组合类型的设计初衷，就是让开发者用起来比较顺手，不跟普通变量产生太多差异。</span></p><p data-lake-id="cc68a94623e742ead657dff4a0888f54" id="cc68a94623e742ead657dff4a0888f54"><span data-lake-id="ucc303c0a" id="ucc303c0a" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id="07a5757e3a94579b4727a94d15ea3735" id="07a5757e3a94579b4727a94d15ea3735"><span data-lake-id="ud89abf24" id="ud89abf24" class="lake-fontsize-12">结构体的定义和初始化：</span></p><ul list="u84ae095a"><li fid="u7d0c842a" data-lake-id="ueaf3cbe8" id="ueaf3cbe8"><span data-lake-id="u85fe87b8" id="u85fe87b8" class="lake-fontsize-12">由于结构体内部拥有多个不同类型的成员，因此初始化采用与数组类似的列表方式。</span></li><li fid="u7d0c842a" data-lake-id="ubca2419c" id="ubca2419c"><span data-lake-id="ufbcbe46d" id="ufbcbe46d" class="lake-fontsize-12">结构体的初始化有两种方式：①普通初始化；②指定成员初始化。</span></li><li fid="u7d0c842a" data-lake-id="u006a0c2c" id="u006a0c2c"><span data-lake-id="ua895e3db" id="ua895e3db" class="lake-fontsize-12">为了能适应结构体类型的升级迭代，一般建议采用指定成员初始化。</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="19194351a9f74e8be7d4ad5373082771" id="19194351a9f74e8be7d4ad5373082771"><span data-lake-id="u54501038" id="u54501038" class="lake-fontsize-12">示例：</span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%2F%2F%201%EF%BC%8C%E6%99%AE%E9%80%9A%E5%88%9D%E5%A7%8B%E5%8C%96%5Cnstruct%20student%20stu%20%3D%20%7B%20%5C%22Tom%5C%22%2C%2012%2C%2018%2C%20'A'%2C%20136.5%20%7D%3B%5Cn%5Cn%2F%2F%202%EF%BC%8C%E6%8C%87%E5%AE%9A%E6%88%90%E5%91%98%E5%88%9D%E5%A7%8B%E5%8C%96%5Cnstruct%20student%20stu%20%3D%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20.name%20%3D%20%5C%22Tom%5C%22%2C%20%20%2F%2F%20%E6%AD%A4%E5%A4%84%EF%BC%8C%E5%B0%8F%E5%9C%86%E7%82%B9.%E8%A2%AB%E7%A7%B0%E4%B8%BA%E6%88%90%E5%91%98%E5%BC%95%E7%94%A8%E7%AC%A6%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20.num%20%3D%2012%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20.age%20%3D%2018%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20.group%20%3D%20'A'%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20.score%20%3D%20136.5%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%7D%3B%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22MxioE%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="d38b171a8b73148cef275ead2fa22a86" id="d38b171a8b73148cef275ead2fa22a86"><span data-lake-id="u2cca388f" id="u2cca388f" class="lake-fontsize-12">指定成员初始化的好处：</span></p><ul list="uad9ef7d9"><li fid="u54f5e2c2" data-lake-id="uef259262" id="uef259262"><span data-lake-id="u8eaa2c17" id="u8eaa2c17" class="lake-fontsize-12">成员初始化的次序可以改变。</span></li><li fid="u54f5e2c2" data-lake-id="u886d1551" id="u886d1551"><span data-lake-id="u589f8a22" id="u589f8a22" class="lake-fontsize-12">可以初始化一部分成员。</span></li><li fid="u54f5e2c2" data-lake-id="u2bb008fe" id="u2bb008fe"><span data-lake-id="u012c331d" id="u012c331d" class="lake-fontsize-12">结构体新增了成员之后初始化语句仍然可用。</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="126bfcdd7e090f137729671d4628dda0" id="126bfcdd7e090f137729671d4628dda0"><span data-lake-id="u8cac1b18" id="u8cac1b18" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id="403d0942efc0ec2dec0ef2151b63bbd7" id="403d0942efc0ec2dec0ef2151b63bbd7"><span data-lake-id="uab72b60c" id="uab72b60c" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id="1c9578465ff5873d8473306432b11514" id="1c9578465ff5873d8473306432b11514"><span data-lake-id="u06b1993c" id="u06b1993c" class="lake-fontsize-12">结构体成员引用</span></p><p data-lake-id="87efde85e611603126ca27e7000e1b77" id="87efde85e611603126ca27e7000e1b77"><span data-lake-id="u28ed12ca" id="u28ed12ca" class="lake-fontsize-12">结构体相当于一个集合，内部包含了众多成员，每个成员实际上都是独立的变量，都可以被独立地引用。引用结构体成员非常简单，只需要使用一个成员引用符.即可：</span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%84%E4%BD%93.%E6%88%90%E5%91%98%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22BJgiz%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="a26faeaea3917c3dd85c56ebd56dc10b" id="a26faeaea3917c3dd85c56ebd56dc10b"><span data-lake-id="u48536f6d" id="u48536f6d" class="lake-fontsize-12">示例：</span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22stu.name%20%3D%20%5C%22Tom%5C%22%3B%2F%2F%E4%B8%8D%E5%8F%AF%E5%AF%B9%E6%95%B0%E7%BB%84%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E5%A4%8D%E5%88%B6----%E3%80%8Bstrcpy(stu.name%2C%5C%22rose%5C%22)%3B%5Cnstu.num%20%3D%2012%3B%5Cnstu.age%20%3D%2018%3B%5Cnstu.group%20%3D%20'A'%3B%5Cnstu.score%20%3D%20136.5%3B%5Cnprintf(%5C%22%25s%2C%20%25d%2C%20%25d%2C%20%25c%2C%20%25f%20%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2C%20stu.name%2C%20stu.num%2C%20stu.age%2C%20stu.group%2C%20stu.score)%3B%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22X9INn%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="dca34040a1f925817952093185196944" id="dca34040a1f925817952093185196944"><span data-lake-id="u2cb78afd" id="u2cb78afd" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id="a6846f7b7e2a27fd58af503234793be4" id="a6846f7b7e2a27fd58af503234793be4"><span data-lake-id="uc219638a" id="uc219638a" class="lake-fontsize-12">结构体指针与数组</span></p><p data-lake-id="66a8b1f196f570363a75dfefaadde874" id="66a8b1f196f570363a75dfefaadde874"><span data-lake-id="u407d8da4" id="u407d8da4" class="lake-fontsize-12">跟普通变量别无二致，可以定义指向结构体的指针，也可以定义结构体数组。</span></p><p data-lake-id="c185679521bac21c71f0f241a80a4ab8" id="c185679521bac21c71f0f241a80a4ab8"><span data-lake-id="u11ecdc12" id="u11ecdc12" class="lake-fontsize-12">结构体指针：</span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22struct%20student%20%20stu%20%3D%20%7B%20%5C%22Tom%5C%22%2C%2012%2C%2018%2C%20'A'%2C%20136.5%20%7D%3B%5Cnstruct%20student%20*p%20%3D%20%26stu%3B%5Cn%5Cn%2F%2F%20%E4%BB%A5%E4%B8%8B%E8%AF%AD%E5%8F%A5%E9%83%BD%E6%98%AF%E7%AD%89%E4%BB%B7%E7%9A%84%5Cnprintf(%5C%22%25d%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2C%20%20%20stu.age)%3B%5Cnprintf(%5C%22%25d%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2C%20(*p).age)%3B%5Cnprintf(%5C%22%25d%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2C%20%20p-%3Eage)%3B%20%20%2F%2F%20%E7%AE%AD%E5%A4%B4%20-%3E%20%E6%98%AF%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%84%E4%BD%93%E6%8C%87%E9%92%88%E7%9A%84%E6%88%90%E5%91%98%E5%BC%95%E7%94%A8%E7%AC%A6%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22fHIu3%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="aa94f1d07864c3be0cfbbfe754ea4496" id="aa94f1d07864c3be0cfbbfe754ea4496"><span data-lake-id="u594da625" id="u594da625" class="lake-fontsize-12">结构体数组：</span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22struct%20student%20arr%5B5%5D%3B%5Cnarr%5B0%5D.name%20%3D%20%5C%22Tom%5C%22%3B%5Cnarr%5B0%5D.num%20%3D%2012%3B%5Cnarr%5B0%5D.age%20%3D%2018%3B%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22xdIcF%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="a9c39dd014db47fde9339cc734810c41" id="a9c39dd014db47fde9339cc734810c41"><span data-lake-id="ub632e8b5" id="ub632e8b5" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><h1 data-lake-id="IaHbg" id="IaHbg"><span data-lake-id="ua2e33a62" id="ua2e33a62">2.结构体尺寸</span></h1><p data-lake-id="44f38c30ea56b8938189303b6cde4be2" id="44f38c30ea56b8938189303b6cde4be2"><em><span data-lake-id="uc7486af1" id="uc7486af1" class="lake-fontsize-12">cpu字长</span></em></p><p data-lake-id="c70825fb1a4891516f0d2bb6cd9be6e2" id="c70825fb1a4891516f0d2bb6cd9be6e2" style="text-indent: 2em"><span data-lake-id="u0952676f" id="u0952676f" class="lake-fontsize-12">字长的概念指的是处理器在一条指令中的数据处理能力，当然这个能力还需要搭配操作系统的设定，比如常见的32位系统、64位系统，指的是在此系统环境下，处理器一次存储处理的数据可以达32位或64位。</span></p><p data-lake-id="8946add970d6cedfa699ad84cbeaf3ac" id="8946add970d6cedfa699ad84cbeaf3ac"><em><span data-lake-id="u0fd929cf" id="u0fd929cf" class="lake-fontsize-12">地址对齐</span></em></p><p data-lake-id="cc20381d30f595bd5e8c1c2eb8a16e7a" id="cc20381d30f595bd5e8c1c2eb8a16e7a" style="text-indent: 2em"><span data-lake-id="u56d9a966" id="u56d9a966" class="lake-fontsize-12">CPU字长确定之后，相当于明确了系统每次存取内存数据时的边界，以32位系统为例，32位意味着CPU每次存取都以4字节为边界，因此每4字节可以认为是CPU存取内存数据的一个单元。</span></p><p data-lake-id="3ae69c9685e49e9096b730787cf800f5" id="3ae69c9685e49e9096b730787cf800f5" style="text-indent: 2em"><span data-lake-id="u2ff13e28" id="u2ff13e28" class="lake-fontsize-12">如果存取的数据刚好落在所需单元数之内，那么我们就说这个数据的地址是对齐的，如果存取的数据跨越了边界，使用了超过所需单元的字节，那么我们就说这个数据的地址是未对齐的。</span></p><p data-lake-id="b8f7ca2331414083dc2e9683d6d5740d" id="b8f7ca2331414083dc2e9683d6d5740d"><span data-lake-id="u34d0f16a" id="u34d0f16a" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id="de04874cdfa464e37987f6f6768a3bc0" id="de04874cdfa464e37987f6f6768a3bc0"><em><span data-lake-id="ua725fe63" id="ua725fe63" class="lake-fontsize-12">例如：32位的CPU读取一个4字节的int最少需要一次内存访问，最多需要2次访问内存。下图中左面，取一个int要两次内存访问，而右边的只需要一次内存访问。</span></em></p><p data-lake-id="730d9b5395596ab966601f77a2af0e5f" id="730d9b5395596ab966601f77a2af0e5f" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F46168485%2F1735560167605-9269f1dd-1783-4bdc-998c-ec464aec121d.png%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A368%2C%22originHeight%22%3A79%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23cce8cf%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22dchyU%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ba3f23adcca12c1d0e930700fff34a74" id="ba3f23adcca12c1d0e930700fff34a74"><em><span data-lake-id="u90debe6c" id="u90debe6c" class="lake-fontsize-12">总结：</span></em></p><p data-lake-id="85da4c4f3cf154e8366efd50cb1f18b6" id="85da4c4f3cf154e8366efd50cb1f18b6" style="text-indent: 2em"><span data-lake-id="ue1b4e683" id="ue1b4e683" class="lake-fontsize-12">如果一个数据满足以最小单元数存放在内存中，则称它地址是对齐的，否则是未对齐的。地址对齐的含义用大白话说就是1个单元能塞得下的就不用2个；2个单元能塞得下的就不用3个。</span></p><p data-lake-id="cb9d1e58eb648c3acdc2739a421199d0" id="cb9d1e58eb648c3acdc2739a421199d0" style="text-indent: 2em"><span data-lake-id="u0b97c5bd" id="u0b97c5bd" class="lake-fontsize-12">如果发生数据地址未对齐的情况，有些系统会直接罢工，有些系统则降低性能。</span></p><p data-lake-id="fe060f54cdf472f88a83d9c2723bf075" id="fe060f54cdf472f88a83d9c2723bf075"><span data-lake-id="uf48f5560" id="uf48f5560" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id="e1d7a81f76ef78eeeffb390c0d80cfeb" id="e1d7a81f76ef78eeeffb390c0d80cfeb"><span data-lake-id="udbb4e01f" id="udbb4e01f" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id="63ddfbf2174a4c2a08afdd96d8a5ae8e" id="63ddfbf2174a4c2a08afdd96d8a5ae8e"><span data-lake-id="u3912c4c6" id="u3912c4c6" class="lake-fontsize-12">普通变量的m值</span><strong><span data-lake-id="udfa5e2da" id="udfa5e2da" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="c7b555d7c9b4bb556202ab6c5591be67" id="c7b555d7c9b4bb556202ab6c5591be67" style="text-indent: 2em"><span data-lake-id="u24a1fc12" id="u24a1fc12" class="lake-fontsize-12">以32位系统为例，由于CPU存取数据总是以4字节为单元，因此对于一个尺寸固定的数据而言，当它的地址满足某个数的整数倍时，就可以保证地址对齐。</span></p><p data-lake-id="ud9211ab4" id="ud9211ab4" style="text-indent: 2em"><span data-lake-id="uad19fd9c" id="uad19fd9c" class="lake-fontsize-12">这个数就被称为变量的m值。</span></p><p data-lake-id="b2e81606aa95c49f32c764d94dc86095" id="b2e81606aa95c49f32c764d94dc86095"><span data-lake-id="u753dad90" id="u753dad90" class="lake-fontsize-12">根据具体系统的字长，和数据本身的尺寸，m值是可以很简单计算出来的。</span></p><p data-lake-id="4aa8fa244da9f172d6f3a0b192fed837" id="4aa8fa244da9f172d6f3a0b192fed837"><span data-lake-id="u237baf0e" id="u237baf0e" class="lake-fontsize-12">手工干预变量的m值：</span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22char%20c%20__attribute__((aligned(32)))%3B%20%2F%2F%20%E5%B0%86%E5%8F%98%E9%87%8F%20c%20%E7%9A%84m%E5%80%BC%E8%AE%BE%E7%BD%AE%E4%B8%BA32%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22qDmXk%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="5be4bf9423c93a1bd20fafba83f00ab3" id="5be4bf9423c93a1bd20fafba83f00ab3"><span data-lake-id="u8bf4ce7d" id="u8bf4ce7d" class="lake-fontsize-12">语法：</span></p><ul list="u762584bf"><li fid="u5deaf895" data-lake-id="u801c7335" id="u801c7335"><span data-lake-id="ua69fb9b3" id="ua69fb9b3" class="lake-fontsize-12">attribute 机制是GNU特定语法，属于C语言标准语法的扩展。</span></li><li fid="u5deaf895" data-lake-id="u888e881b" id="u888e881b"><span data-lake-id="ud08d9cb3" id="ud08d9cb3" class="lake-fontsize-12">attribute 前后都是双下划线，aligned两边是双圆括号。</span></li><li fid="u5deaf895" data-lake-id="ud4e1b20b" id="ud4e1b20b"><span data-lake-id="u4553e2fe" id="u4553e2fe" class="lake-fontsize-12">attribute 语句，出现在变量定义语句中的分号前面，变量标识符后面。</span></li><li fid="u5deaf895" data-lake-id="uda80fa7b" id="uda80fa7b"><span data-lake-id="ue4897bfb" id="ue4897bfb" class="lake-fontsize-12">attribute 机制支持多种属性设置，其中 aligned 用来设置变量的 m 值属性。</span></li><li fid="u5deaf895" data-lake-id="uec3188c4" id="uec3188c4"><span data-lake-id="u5de93952" id="u5de93952" class="lake-fontsize-12">一个变量的 m 值只能提升，不能降低，且只能为正的2的n次幂。</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="4d1e10eadb675c7ef0a7500a7846e8fe" id="4d1e10eadb675c7ef0a7500a7846e8fe"><span data-lake-id="u52bd0265" id="u52bd0265" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id="5d52288eed5e9480bea9035c22aa9adc" id="5d52288eed5e9480bea9035c22aa9adc"><span data-lake-id="u0c460f93" id="u0c460f93" class="lake-fontsize-12">结构体的M值</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u0bce0825" id="u0bce0825" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span></strong></p><ul list="u4f00c39f"><li fid="u145caf4e" data-lake-id="ub8e2fbea" id="ub8e2fbea"><span data-lake-id="u5d231ba3" id="u5d231ba3" class="lake-fontsize-12">结构体的M值，取决于其成员的m值的最大值。即：M = max{m1, m2, m3, ...};</span></li><li fid="u145caf4e" data-lake-id="u7da7f186" id="u7da7f186"><span data-lake-id="u44ed357f" id="u44ed357f" class="lake-fontsize-12">结构体的地址和尺寸，都必须等于M值的整数倍。</span></li></ul><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22struct%20node%5Cn%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20short%20%20a%3B%20%2F%2F%20%E5%B0%BA%E5%AF%B8%3D2%EF%BC%8Cm%E5%80%BC%3D2%5Cn%20%20%20%20double%20b%3B%20%2F%2F%20%E5%B0%BA%E5%AF%B8%3D8%EF%BC%8Cm%E5%80%BC%3D8%EF%BC%8864%E4%BD%8D%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F%EF%BC%89%5Cn%20%20%20%20char%20%20%20c%3B%20%2F%2F%20%E5%B0%BA%E5%AF%B8%3D1%EF%BC%8Cm%E5%80%BC%3D1%5Cn%7D%3B%5Cn%5Cnstruct%20node%20n%3B%20%2F%2F%20M%E5%80%BC%20%3D%20max%7B2%2C%208%2C%201%7D%20%3D%208%3B%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22HQNQ2%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="6f989184d55208f9dfd9d49dead36015" id="6f989184d55208f9dfd9d49dead36015"><span data-lake-id="u1f34395c" id="u1f34395c" class="lake-fontsize-12">结构体压实:__attribute__((packed))</span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22struct%20node%5Cn%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20short%20%20a%3B%20%2F%2F%20%E5%B0%BA%E5%AF%B8%3D2%EF%BC%8Cm%E5%80%BC%3D2%5Cn%20%20%20%20double%20b%3B%20%2F%2F%20%E5%B0%BA%E5%AF%B8%3D8%EF%BC%8Cm%E5%80%BC%3D8%5Cn%20%20%20%20char%20%20%20c%3B%20%2F%2F%20%E5%B0%BA%E5%AF%B8%3D1%EF%BC%8Cm%E5%80%BC%3D1%5Cn%7D__attribute__((packed))%3B%5Cn%2F%2F2%2B8%2B1%3D11%EF%BC%9B%E8%8B%A5%E4%B8%8D%E5%8E%8B%E5%AE%9E--%E3%80%8B8%2B8%2B8%3D24%EF%BC%8864%E4%BD%8D%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F%EF%BC%89%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22cZxHj%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="ua3fd12ca" id="ua3fd12ca"><card type="inline" name="label" value="data:%7B%22label%22%3A%22%E8%A1%A5%E5%85%85%22%2C%22colorIndex%22%3A2%2C%22id%22%3A%22iChwB%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card><span data-lake-id="u0de0dfc2" id="u0de0dfc2" class="lake-fontsize-12">：</span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22struct%20node%2F%2F%E6%9C%AA%E5%A1%AB%E6%BB%A1%E5%88%99%E7%B4%A7%E6%8E%A5%E7%9D%80%E5%90%91%E5%90%8E%E5%A1%AB%E5%85%85---%E3%80%8B%E5%85%88%E5%A1%AB%E5%85%85%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E5%85%83%E7%B4%A0%EF%BC%9B2%E4%B8%AA8%E4%BD%8D%E5%B0%B1%E5%A4%9F%E4%BA%86%5Cn%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20char%20%20%20c%3B%20%2F%2F%20%E5%B0%BA%E5%AF%B8%3D1%EF%BC%8Cm%E5%80%BC%3D1%5Cn%20%20%20%20short%20%20a%3B%20%2F%2F%20%E5%B0%BA%E5%AF%B8%3D2%EF%BC%8Cm%E5%80%BC%3D2%5Cn%20%20%20%20double%20b%3B%20%2F%2F%20%E5%B0%BA%E5%AF%B8%3D8%EF%BC%8Cm%E5%80%BC%3D8%EF%BC%8864%E4%BD%8D%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F%EF%BC%89%5Cn%20%20%20%5Cn%7D%3B----%E3%80%8B%E5%A4%A7%E5%B0%8F16%5Cn%5Cnstruct%20node%2F%2F3%E4%B8%AA8%E4%BD%8D%E6%89%8D%E5%8F%AF%5Cn%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20short%20%20a%3B%20%2F%2F%20%E5%B0%BA%E5%AF%B8%3D2%EF%BC%8Cm%E5%80%BC%3D2%5Cn%20%20%20%20double%20b%3B%20%2F%2F%20%E5%B0%BA%E5%AF%B8%3D8%EF%BC%8Cm%E5%80%BC%3D8%5Cn%20%20%20%20char%20%20%20c%3B%20%2F%2F%20%E5%B0%BA%E5%AF%B8%3D1%EF%BC%8Cm%E5%80%BC%3D1%5Cn%20%20%20%5Cn%7D%3B----%E3%80%8B%E5%A4%A7%E5%B0%8F24%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22iBbyW%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="u18e3eab5" id="u18e3eab5"><card type="inline" name="label" value="data:%7B%22label%22%3A%22%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%84%E4%BD%93%E7%9A%84%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E5%AF%B9%E9%BD%90%22%2C%22colorIndex%22%3A2%2C%22id%22%3A%22Td0oR%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card><span data-lake-id="uefeb85f1" id="uefeb85f1" class="lake-fontsize-12">：</span></p><p data-lake-id="uc50946ec" id="uc50946ec"><span data-lake-id="ub16d8f73" id="ub16d8f73">结构体内存对齐是指编译器为了提高CPU访问效率，会按照一定规则给结构体成员分配内存，在成员之间插入一些无效的填充字节，同时遵循，每个成员首地址偏移量必须是该成员大小整数倍，结构体整体大小必须是最大成员对齐数的整数倍，必要时也可以使用__attribute__((packed))或编译指令 #pragma pack   进行压实</span></p><h1 data-lake-id="xcSB6" id="xcSB6"><span data-lake-id="ucf65a9b7" id="ucf65a9b7">3.联合体</span></h1><p data-lake-id="74c348d5dff2ec5810bed29fb07fca56" id="74c348d5dff2ec5810bed29fb07fca56"><span data-lake-id="u87bcaefe" id="u87bcaefe" class="lake-fontsize-12">联合体的外在形式跟结构体非常类似，但它们有一个本质的区别：</span></p><p data-lake-id="u7511ed54" id="u7511ed54"><span data-lake-id="u1122d1f8" id="u1122d1f8" class="lake-fontsize-12">结构体中的各个成员是各自独立的，而联合体中的各个成员却共用同一块内存，因此联合体也称为共用体。</span></p><p data-lake-id="77baea7dc26b7b3014f5bd390f2e5b72" id="77baea7dc26b7b3014f5bd390f2e5b72" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F46168485%2F1735560167734-a750f0f6-7579-494d-9f94-4264d2645dcf.png%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A407%2C%22height%22%3A187%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A720%2C%22originHeight%22%3A330%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f6eecb%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ozIyD%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><p data-lake-id="b0a55cb590002d119e1cb0f57cbab031" id="b0a55cb590002d119e1cb0f57cbab031" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u0bc673c3" id="u0bc673c3" class="lake-fontsize-12">联合体各成员的堆叠效果</span></p><p data-lake-id="a54765b84f142a75efebec33a4677c45" id="a54765b84f142a75efebec33a4677c45"><span data-lake-id="u8bed0371" id="u8bed0371" class="lake-fontsize-12">联合体内部成员的这种特殊的“堆叠”效果，使得联合体有如下基本特征：</span></p><ul list="udc8f2616"><li fid="u35e3cfbe" data-lake-id="u732580ba" id="u732580ba"><span data-lake-id="udddd0f4f" id="udddd0f4f" class="lake-fontsize-12">整个联合体变量的尺寸，取决于联合体中尺寸最大的成员。</span></li><li fid="u35e3cfbe" data-lake-id="u7d1a90d0" id="u7d1a90d0"><span data-lake-id="u38f5781c" id="u38f5781c" class="lake-fontsize-12">给联合体的某个成员赋值，会覆盖其他的成员，使它们失效。</span></li><li fid="u35e3cfbe" data-lake-id="u913fb565" id="u913fb565"><span data-lake-id="u304fbdc5" id="u304fbdc5" class="lake-fontsize-12">联合体各成员之间形成一种“互斥”的逻辑，在某个时刻只有一个成员有效。</span></li><li fid="u35e3cfbe" data-lake-id="ua1f3bc4a" id="ua1f3bc4a"><span data-lake-id="u5284bb57" id="u5284bb57" class="lake-fontsize-12">最终联合体大小还要注意是最大成员类型的整数倍</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="0646dd7bc06048324a211aee8e6fdc0a" id="0646dd7bc06048324a211aee8e6fdc0a"><span data-lake-id="u985bbb0a" id="u985bbb0a" class="lake-fontsize-12">定义：</span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22union%20%E8%81%94%E5%90%88%E4%BD%93%E6%A0%87%E7%AD%BE%5Cn%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%E6%88%90%E5%91%981%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%E6%88%90%E5%91%982%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20...%5Cn%7D%3B%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22MSDDP%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="5f2f333b1e9904d5ddc2babe7abbc73c" id="5f2f333b1e9904d5ddc2babe7abbc73c"><span data-lake-id="u665176be" id="u665176be" class="lake-fontsize-12">语法：</span></p><ul list="ude39ffc1"><li fid="ua1c7916c" data-lake-id="u6ece9a08" id="u6ece9a08"><span data-lake-id="u1da3a4a0" id="u1da3a4a0" class="lake-fontsize-12">联合体标签，用来区分各个不同的联合体。</span></li><li fid="ua1c7916c" data-lake-id="u8c735fd4" id="u8c735fd4"><span data-lake-id="uf8f4b50a" id="uf8f4b50a" class="lake-fontsize-12">成员，是包含在联合体内部的数据，可以是任意的数据类型。</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="49622f55332766675a2d559281b6643d" id="49622f55332766675a2d559281b6643d"><span data-lake-id="uc32905a5" id="uc32905a5" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%2F%2F%20%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%E4%BA%86%E4%B8%80%E7%A7%8D%E7%A7%B0%E4%B8%BA%20union%20attr%20%E7%9A%84%E8%81%94%E5%90%88%E4%BD%93%E7%B1%BB%E5%9E%8B%5Cnunion%20attr%5Cn%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20int%20x%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20char%20y%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20double%20z%3B%20%20%5Cn%7D%3B%5Cn%5Cnint%20main()%5Cn%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%20%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%E8%81%94%E5%90%88%E4%BD%93%E5%8F%98%E9%87%8F%5Cn%20%20%20%20union%20attr%20n%3B%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22glRhs%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="1df69392669b3a3c4aea0a68ba86d9f3" id="1df69392669b3a3c4aea0a68ba86d9f3" style="text-indent: 2em"><span data-lake-id="u4d2a1d34" id="u4d2a1d34" class="lake-fontsize-12">联合体的操作跟结构体形式上别无二致，但由于联合体特殊的存储特性，不管怎么初始化和赋值，最终都有且仅有一个成员是有效的。</span></p><p data-lake-id="4b54cb6a6ec45475e7271bb5cdd768d0" id="4b54cb6a6ec45475e7271bb5cdd768d0"><span data-lake-id="uecd901cf" id="uecd901cf" class="lake-fontsize-12">初始化：</span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%2F%2F%20%E6%99%AE%E9%80%9A%E5%88%9D%E5%A7%8B%E5%8C%96%EF%BC%9A%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E6%88%90%E5%91%98%E6%9C%89%E6%95%88%EF%BC%88%E5%8D%B3%E5%8F%AA%E6%9C%89100%E6%98%AF%E6%9C%89%E6%95%88%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E5%85%B6%E4%BD%99%E6%88%90%E5%91%98%E4%BC%9A%E8%A2%AB%E8%A6%86%E7%9B%96%EF%BC%89%5Cnunion%20attr%20at%20%3D%20%7B100%2C%20'k'%2C%203.14%7D%3B%5Cn%5Cn%2F%2F%20%E6%8C%87%E5%AE%9A%E6%88%90%E5%91%98%E5%88%9D%E5%A7%8B%E5%8C%96%EF%BC%9A%E6%9C%80%E5%90%8E%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E6%88%90%E5%91%98%E6%9C%89%E6%95%88%EF%BC%88%E5%8D%B3%E5%8F%AA%E6%9C%893.14%E6%98%AF%E6%9C%89%E6%95%88%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E5%85%B6%E4%BD%99%E6%88%90%E5%91%98%E4%BC%9A%E8%A2%AB%E8%A6%86%E7%9B%96%EF%BC%89%5Cnunion%20attr%20at%20%3D%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20.x%20%20%3D%20100%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20.y%20%3D%20'k'%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20.z%20%3D%203.14%2C%5Cn%7D%3B%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22CORu4%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="3ea5fe6c6977991789c8edab9039f11d" id="3ea5fe6c6977991789c8edab9039f11d"><span data-lake-id="u87cc708d" id="u87cc708d" class="lake-fontsize-12">成员引用：</span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22at.x%20%3D%20100%3B%5Cnat.y%20%3D%20'k'%3B%5Cnat.z%20%3D%203.14%3B%20%2F%2F%20%E5%8F%AA%E6%9C%89%E6%9C%80%E5%90%8E%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E8%B5%8B%E5%80%BC%E7%9A%84%E6%88%90%E5%91%98%E6%9C%89%E6%95%88%5Cn%5Cnprintf(%5C%22%25d%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2C%20at.x)%3B%5Cnprintf(%5C%22%25c%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2C%20at.y)%3B%5Cnprintf(%5C%22%25lf%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2C%20at.z)%3B%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22rJWZq%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="f6864dd372f1fe64c0caa9c6190adbb8" id="f6864dd372f1fe64c0caa9c6190adbb8"><span data-lake-id="u31738f5d" id="u31738f5d" class="lake-fontsize-12">联合体指针：</span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22union%20attr%20*p%20%3D%20%26at%3B%5Cnp-%3Ex%20%3D%20100%3B%5Cnp-%3Ey%20%3D%20'k'%3B%5Cnp-%3Ez%20%3D%203.14%3B%20%20%2F%2F%20%E5%8F%AA%E6%9C%89%E6%9C%80%E5%90%8E%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E8%B5%8B%E5%80%BC%E7%9A%84%E6%88%90%E5%91%98%E6%9C%89%E6%95%88%5Cn%5Cnprintf(%5C%22%25d%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2C%20p-%3Ex)%3B%5Cnprintf(%5C%22%25c%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2C%20p-%3Ey)%3B%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22A1gPg%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="7445061a98afbbef63fa39382752242c" id="7445061a98afbbef63fa39382752242c"><span data-lake-id="u5a9a76d5" id="u5a9a76d5" class="lake-fontsize-12">联合体使用：</span></p><p data-lake-id="70a2d4c01f5109cd0e2b65c5ee41a981" id="70a2d4c01f5109cd0e2b65c5ee41a981" style="text-indent: 2em"><span data-lake-id="u943d1403" id="u943d1403" class="lake-fontsize-12">联合体一般很少单独使用，而经常以结构体的成员形式存在，用来表达某种互斥的属性</span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22struct%20node%5Cn%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20int%20a%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20char%20b%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20double%20c%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20union%20attr%20at%3B%20%2F%2F%20at%E5%86%85%E6%9C%89%E4%B8%89%E7%A7%8D%E4%BA%92%E6%96%A5%E7%9A%84%E5%B1%9E%E6%80%A7%EF%BC%8C%E9%9D%9E%E6%AD%A4%E5%8D%B3%E5%BD%BC%5Cn%7D%3B%5Cn%5Cnint%20main()%5Cn%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20struct%20node%20n%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20n.at.x%20%3D%20100%3B%20%2F%2F%20%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E8%BF%9E%E7%BB%AD%E7%9A%84%E6%88%90%E5%91%98%E5%BC%95%E7%94%A8%E7%AC%A6%E6%9D%A5%E7%B4%A2%E5%BC%95%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%84%E4%BD%93%E4%B8%AD%E7%9A%84%E8%81%94%E5%90%88%E4%BD%93%E6%88%90%E5%91%98%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Mcsbe%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%2F%2F%E5%A4%A7%E5%B0%8F%5Cntypedef%20union%5Cn%7B%5Cnshort%20c%3B%2F%2F2%5Cndouble%20d%3B%2F%2F8%5Cnint%20k%5B5%5D%3B%2F%2F20%5Cn%7DDate%3B%5Cn------%E3%80%8B%E6%9C%80%E5%A4%A7%E6%88%90%E5%91%98%E7%B1%BB%E5%9E%8B%E4%B8%BA8%EF%BC%8C%E6%9C%80%E5%A4%A7%E6%88%90%E5%91%98%E4%B8%BA20--%E3%80%8B%E6%BB%A1%E8%B6%B38%E7%9A%84%E5%80%8D%E6%95%B0%E6%95%8524%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uBtO9%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><h1 data-lake-id="PKWCE" id="PKWCE"><span data-lake-id="u3f7c054f" id="u3f7c054f">4.枚举</span></h1><p data-lake-id="95f4ac0d899f8e18e387855cc7bc677e" id="95f4ac0d899f8e18e387855cc7bc677e" style="text-indent: 2em"><span data-lake-id="u872b50cf" id="u872b50cf" class="lake-fontsize-12">枚举类型的本质是提供一种范围受限的整型，比如用0-6表示七种颜色，用0-3表示四种状态等。</span></p><p data-lake-id="58b53e27ac95da41e3b6d88aaba78226" id="58b53e27ac95da41e3b6d88aaba78226"><span data-lake-id="u0a24201b" id="u0a24201b" class="lake-fontsize-12">枚举常量列表：</span></p><ul list="ubdf229ba"><li fid="u5bd146cd" data-lake-id="ud7540001" id="ud7540001"><span data-lake-id="uaa2df797" id="uaa2df797" class="lake-fontsize-12">enum是关键字</span></li><li fid="u5bd146cd" data-lake-id="u9b9a4ed7" id="u9b9a4ed7"><span data-lake-id="u2d8bfd2d" id="u2d8bfd2d" class="lake-fontsize-12">week是枚举常量列表标签</span></li></ul><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22enum%20week%7B%20Mon%2C%20Tues%2C%20Wed%2C%20Thurs%2C%20Fri%2C%20Sat%2C%20Sun%20%7D%3B%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22HuFD2%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="186264b6bc761a991f7828667be467dc" id="186264b6bc761a991f7828667be467dc"><span data-lake-id="u0bd4c4ea" id="u0bd4c4ea" class="lake-fontsize-12">语法要点：</span></p><ul list="ua0614921"><li fid="ud6e30814" data-lake-id="u3833b77e" id="u3833b77e"><span data-lake-id="uaa06cd2a" id="uaa06cd2a" class="lake-fontsize-12">枚举常量实质上就是整型，首个枚举常量默认为0。</span></li><li fid="ud6e30814" data-lake-id="u0ec6093e" id="u0ec6093e"><span data-lake-id="ua2beef90" id="ua2beef90" class="lake-fontsize-12">枚举常量在定义时可以赋值，若不赋值，则取其前面的枚举常量的值加1。</span></li><li fid="ud6e30814" data-lake-id="u293ec5ba" id="u293ec5ba"><span data-lake-id="u40a53b7f" id="u40a53b7f" class="lake-fontsize-12">C语言中，枚举等价于整型，支持整型数据的一切操作。</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="88404bf4aad988379179c9d14b1aa6b4" id="88404bf4aad988379179c9d14b1aa6b4"><span data-lake-id="u9806f1dd" id="u9806f1dd" class="lake-fontsize-12">也可以赋初始值</span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22enum%20week%7B%20Mon%20%3D%201%2C%20Tues%20%3D%202%2C%20Wed%20%3D%203%2C%20Thurs%20%3D%204%2C%20Fri%20%3D%205%2C%20Sat%20%3D%206%2C%20Sun%20%3D%207%20%7D%3B%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22CPVgz%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="c900114d8555320fc4219d21d6d7d867" id="c900114d8555320fc4219d21d6d7d867"><span data-lake-id="u8499da65" id="u8499da65" class="lake-fontsize-12">更为简单的方法是只给第一个名字指定值</span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22enum%20week%7B%20Mon%20%3D%201%2C%20Tues%2C%20Wed%2C%20Thurs%2C%20Fri%2C%20Sat%2C%20Sun%20%7D%3B%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Fedva%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="bc147c1cd10674e07194e760cc366848" id="bc147c1cd10674e07194e760cc366848"><span data-lake-id="u314aa45d" id="u314aa45d" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23include%20%3Cstdio.h%3E%5Cn%23include%20%3Cstdlib.h%3E%5Cnint%20main()%5Cn%7B%5Cn%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20enum%20color%20%7B%20red%3D1%2C%20green%2C%20blue%20%7D%3B%5Cn%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20enum%20%20color%20favorite_color%3B%5Cn%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20%2F*%20%E7%94%A8%E6%88%B7%E8%BE%93%E5%85%A5%E6%95%B0%E5%AD%97%E6%9D%A5%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E9%A2%9C%E8%89%B2%20*%2F%5Cn%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22%E8%AF%B7%E8%BE%93%E5%85%A5%E4%BD%A0%E5%96%9C%E6%AC%A2%E7%9A%84%E9%A2%9C%E8%89%B2%3A%20(1.%20red%2C%202.%20green%2C%203.%20blue)%3A%20%5C%22)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20scanf(%5C%22%25u%5C%22%2C%20%26favorite_color)%3B%5Cn%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20%2F*%20%E8%BE%93%E5%87%BA%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9C%20*%2F%5Cn%20%20%20%20switch%20(favorite_color)%5Cn%20%20%20%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20case%20red%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22%E4%BD%A0%E5%96%9C%E6%AC%A2%E7%9A%84%E9%A2%9C%E8%89%B2%E6%98%AF%E7%BA%A2%E8%89%B2%5C%22)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20break%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20case%20green%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22%E4%BD%A0%E5%96%9C%E6%AC%A2%E7%9A%84%E9%A2%9C%E8%89%B2%E6%98%AF%E7%BB%BF%E8%89%B2%5C%22)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20break%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20case%20blue%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22%E4%BD%A0%E5%96%9C%E6%AC%A2%E7%9A%84%E9%A2%9C%E8%89%B2%E6%98%AF%E8%93%9D%E8%89%B2%5C%22)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20break%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20default%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22%E4%BD%A0%E6%B2%A1%E6%9C%89%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E4%BD%A0%E5%96%9C%E6%AC%A2%E7%9A%84%E9%A2%9C%E8%89%B2%5C%22)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%7D%5Cn%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%200%3B%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Wr2aD%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="162dd4fb8ee5be6973b8ce7132cedcb4" id="162dd4fb8ee5be6973b8ce7132cedcb4"><span data-lake-id="u36a7f9db" id="u36a7f9db" class="lake-fontsize-12">枚举数据最重要的作用，是使用有意义的单词，来替代无意义的数字，提高程序的可读性。</span></p><p data-lake-id="u651ed347" id="u651ed347"><card type="inline" name="label" value="data:%7B%22label%22%3A%22%E6%80%BB%E7%BB%93%22%2C%22colorIndex%22%3A1%2C%22id%22%3A%22RaYN9%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card><span data-lake-id="ubf9b1af3" id="ubf9b1af3" class="lake-fontsize-12">：</span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22enum%20weekday%7Bmon%2Ctue%2Cwed%2Cthu%2Cfri%7D%3B%20%2F%2F%20mon%20%3D%200%2Ctue%20%3D%201%2Cwed%20%3D%202%2Cthu%20%3D%203%2Cfri%20%3D%204%5Cn1.%E6%9E%9A%E4%B8%BE%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E5%80%BC%E9%BB%98%E8%AE%A4%E4%B8%BA0%5Cn%5Ct%E6%AF%94%E5%A6%82mon%E4%B8%BA0%2C%E5%90%8E%E9%9D%A2%E7%9A%84%E5%A4%A7%E5%B0%8F%E4%BE%9D%E4%BB%A5%E6%AD%A4%E7%B1%BB%E6%8E%A8%201%2C2%2C3%2C4%5Cn%5Ct%5Cn2.%E5%A6%82%E6%9E%9C%E6%9E%9A%E4%B8%BE%E5%8F%98%E9%87%8F%E9%87%8C%E9%9D%A2%E6%9F%90%E4%B8%AA%E6%88%90%E5%91%98%E8%AE%BE%E7%BD%AE%E4%BA%86%E6%95%B0%E5%80%BC%EF%BC%8C%E5%BE%80%E5%90%8E%E7%9A%84%E5%85%B6%E5%AE%83%E6%88%90%E5%91%98%E7%9A%84%E6%95%B0%E5%80%BC%E5%9C%A8%E5%AE%83%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E4%B8%8A%E8%BF%9B%E8%A1%8C%E7%B4%AF%E5%8A%A0%5Cn%5Ctenum%20weekday%7Bmon%2Ctue%3D100%2Cwed%2Cthu%2Cfri%7D%3B%20%2F%2F%20mon%20%3D%200%2Ctue%20%3D%20100%2Cwed%20%3D%20101%2Cthu%20%3D%20102%2Cfri%20%3D%20103%5Cn%5Ct%5Cn3.%E6%9E%9A%E4%B8%BE%E5%B8%B8%E9%87%8F%E5%AE%9E%E9%99%85%E5%B0%B1%E6%98%AF%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E6%95%B4%E5%9E%8B%EF%BC%8C%E9%A6%96%E4%B8%AA%E6%9E%9A%E4%B8%BE%E5%B8%B8%E9%87%8F%E9%BB%98%E8%AE%A4%E4%B8%BA0%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22rg4Uf%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><h1 data-lake-id="lFvS7" id="lFvS7"><span data-lake-id="u2f041849" id="u2f041849">4.typedef</span></h1><p data-lake-id="b253fc4419aa66ba07b168ef6dc8bb9b" id="b253fc4419aa66ba07b168ef6dc8bb9b"><span data-lake-id="u86de0cdf" id="u86de0cdf" class="lake-fontsize-12">C语言允许为一个数据类型起一个新的别名，就像给人起“绰号”一样。</span></p><p data-lake-id="2386b017376e72857c437faed24f1e1f" id="2386b017376e72857c437faed24f1e1f"><span data-lake-id="uad5ff847" id="uad5ff847" class="lake-fontsize-12">起别名的目的不是为了提高程序运行效率，而是为了编码方便。例如，有一个结构体的名字是 student，定义一个结构体变量stu1，代码如下：</span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22struct%20student%20stu1%3B%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22AnBDI%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="c4d089d08c37dbee428ff5aced8ae7a1" id="c4d089d08c37dbee428ff5aced8ae7a1"><span data-lake-id="udffc1519" id="udffc1519" class="lake-fontsize-12">struct 看起来就是多余的，但不写又会报错。如果为 struct student起了一个别名 Student，书写起来就简单了：</span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22Student%20stu1%3B%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22c45S1%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="31c7fccb68ecfd79a6f90432e955f343" id="31c7fccb68ecfd79a6f90432e955f343"><span data-lake-id="u62d520c2" id="u62d520c2" class="lake-fontsize-12">这种写法更加简练，意义也非常明确，不管是在标准头文件中还是以后的编程实践中，都会大量使用这种别名。</span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23include%20%3Cstdio.h%3E%5Cn%5Cn%2F%2F%20%E7%BB%99%E5%AD%97%E7%AC%A6%E6%8C%87%E9%92%88%E5%8F%96%E5%88%AB%E5%90%8D%5Cntypedef%20char%20*%20String%3B%5Cn%5Cn%2F%2F%20%E7%BB%99%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%84%E4%BD%93%E5%8F%96%E5%88%AB%E5%90%8D%5Cntypedef%20struct%5Cn%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20int%20id%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20String%20name%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20String%20profile%3B%5Cn%7D%20User%3B%20%20%5Cn%5Cnint%20main()%5Cn%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%20%E5%A3%B0%E6%98%8E%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%84%E4%BD%93%E5%8F%98%E9%87%8F%5Cn%20%20%20%20User%20u%3B%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%20%E5%88%9D%E5%A7%8B%E5%8C%96%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%84%E4%BD%93%E5%8F%98%E9%87%8F%E7%9A%84%E5%B1%9E%E6%80%A7%E8%B5%8B%E5%80%BC%5Cn%20%20%20%20u.id%20%3D%20101%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20u.name%20%3D%20%5C%22%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%89%5C%22%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20u.profile%20%3D%20%5C%22%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E7%BA%AF%E7%B2%B9%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E9%AB%98%E5%B0%9A%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E8%84%B1%E7%A6%BB%E4%BA%86%E4%BD%8E%E7%BA%A7%E8%B6%A3%E5%91%B3%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%BA%E3%80%82%5C%22%3B%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%20%E6%89%93%E5%8D%B0%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%84%E4%BD%93%E5%8F%98%E9%87%8F%E7%9A%84%E5%B1%9E%E6%80%A7%5Cn%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22id%EF%BC%9A%25d%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2C%20u.id)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22name%EF%BC%9A%25s%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2C%20u.name)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22profile%EF%BC%9A%25s%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2C%20u.profile)%3B%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20String%20str%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20str%3D%5C%22abc%5C%22%3B%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%200%3B%5Cn%7D%5Cn%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22xbQHh%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card>